# Match guard as a callable function — the guard is invoked with the scrutinee.
# Uses case form: [case [let x] x body] binds scrutinee to x, guard check inlined.
[
    positive?: [fn [let n] [> n 0]]

    result: [match 5
        [case [let x] x [if [positive? x] "positive" "non-positive"]]]
]

---

%.result
=== out
String("positive")
